#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Anarana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Omeo anarana mazava ity kaonty ity izay haseho."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Anaran'ny mpampiasa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa hampiasaina amin'ny fanamarinana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Tenimiafina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Ny tenimiafina ampiasaina amin'ny fanamarinana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Tenimiafina Enable"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Ny Tenimiafina Enable anao, raha ilaina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fitaovana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Esory ny marika amin'ity boaty ity mba tsy ho voatahiry intsony ity Fitaovana ity."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Famaritana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Anaran'ity Fitaovana ity (hampiasaina amin'ny fitahirizana ny fikirakirana sy SVN raha tsy misy anaran'ny mpampiantrano ao amin'ny fikirakirana)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Adiresy IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ity ny Adiresy IP ampiasaina hifandraisana amin'ny fitaovana."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Mpizara TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Mpizara TFTP safidy handikana ny fikandrana avy amin'ity Fitaovana ity. Avelao ho banga raha hampiasa ny fandrindrana Mpizara TFTP ankapobeny."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Fanalahidin'ny Mpampiantrano SSH voatahiry"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Ampitahao amin'ny fitaovana amin'ny alalan'ny fantsona azo antoka ity algôritma fanalahidin'ny mpampiantrano sy dian-tanana hex SHA-1 ity. Ao amin'ny mpizara, soloy ny rakitra fanalahidy ho an'ny daholobe mifanaraka amin'ny mpampiantrano ny lalana etsy ambany ary alefaso: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Ampiasao ny hetsika amin'ny fitaovana hamafana azy aorian'ny fanovana fanalahidy ara-dalàna."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahiry"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Ity no rafitry ny lahatahiry mifandraika ampiasaina hitahirizana ny fikirakirana."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Karazana fandaharam-potoana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Impiry no hanaovana tahiry ity Fitaovana ity. Ny isan'andro miaraka amin'ny Famerenana isaky ny 10 dia manao tahiry isaky ny 10 andro; ny isam-bolana dia manao tahiry tena izy araka ny volana amin'ny tetiandro."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Avereno isaky ny"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana isan'andro, avereno alefa isaky ny X andro ny tahiry fiarovana. Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana isan-kerinandro tsy misy andro voatondro ao anatin'ny herinandro, avereno alefa isaky ny X herinandro izany; raha vao voafantina ny andro ao anatin'ny herinandro dia mandeha amin'ireo andro ireo isan-kerinandro ny tahiry fiarovana ary tsy mihatra intsony ity saha ity."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Andron'ny herinandro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana Isan-kerinandro, ny andro ao anatin'ny herinandro handefasana ny tahiry fiarovana, isan-kerinandro. Avelao ho banga raha handefa isaky ny herinandro voafaritra ao amin'ny Avereno Isaky ny."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Volan'ny taona"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana Isam-bolana, ny volana ao anatin'ny taona handefasana ny tahiry fiarovana."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Andron'ny volana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana Isam-bolana, ny andro ao anatin'ny volana handefasana ny tahiry fiarovana (Farany = andro farany amin'ny volana)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Herinandro ao amin'ny volana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana Isam-bolana amin'ny Andro voatondro, ny herinandro ao anatin'ny volana handefasana ny tahiry fiarovana."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Andro amin'ny herinandro (Isam-bolana)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fandaharam-potoana Isam-bolana amin'ny Andro voatondro, ny andro ao anatin'ny herinandro hiaraka amin'ny safidin'ny Herinandro ao anatin'ny Volana."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
