msgstr "Safidio ny karazana Fitaovana misy ilay router."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Fitiliana ho azy"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Karazana fifandraisana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ity no karazana fifandraisana ampiasaina hifaneraserana amin'ilay fitaovana."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Kaonty fanamarinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Safidio ny kaonty hampiasaina hidirana ao amin'ny router"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tsy misy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Fe-potoana mahazatra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Fotoana fiandrasana valiny mahazatra amin'ny segondra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Fotoana fiatoana mahazatra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Fotoana fiatoana mahazatra amin'ny mikrosegondra (1/1.000.000-n'ny segondra)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Heverina ho manana zo ambony"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty ity mba hiheverana fa manana fahefana avo hatrany ity fitaovana ity"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Anaran'ity karazana Fitaovana ity."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Fangatahana anaran'ny mpampiasa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ity no fangatahana anaran'ny mpampiasa ampitoviana amin'ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Fangatahana tenimiafina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ity no fangatahana tenimiafina ampitoviana amin'ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Rakitra fandrindrana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Ity no toerana mahazatra misy ny rakitra fikirakirana ao amin'ilay fitaovana lavitra. Ampiasaina amin'ny fomba SCP sy SFTP izany"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Adikao TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Ity ny lahatsoratra CLI ampiasaina handefasana ny tahiry fiarovana any amin'ny mpizara tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Baiko fisamborana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Baiko safidy izay tahirizina ho fikandrana ny vokany, fa tsy adika amin'ny mpizara TFTP. Mandeha amin'ny SSH foana izy io, na inona na inona karazana fifandraisana, ary tsy mila mpizara TFTP ny Fitaovana avy eo. Avelao ho banga ho an'ny Fitaovana mandika ny fikandrany amin'ny TFTP. Ohatra ho an'ny MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Asehoy ny dikan-teny"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Ity ny lahatsoratra CLI ampiasaina hampisehoana ny kinova ankehitriny."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Fanontaniana fanamafisana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Ity ny hafatra fanamafisana tsy maintsy ampifanarahina alohan'ny fandefasana."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Hamafiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Misy fangatahana fanamafisana ve alohan'ny handikana ny fikandrana?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Terena ny fanamafisana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Misy fangatahana fanamafisana an-tery ve alohan'ny handikana ny fikandrana?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Hamarino ny End ao amin'ny fikirakirana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Hamarino ny end ao amin'ny fikirakirana?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Fanontaniana Tsindrio izay kitendry"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Lahatsoratra hifanaraka amin'ny fampandrenesana miendrika 'Tsindrio ny bokotra iray mba hanohizana'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Hafatra fangatahana aorian'ny fidirana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Mpivady fanontaniana/valiny safidy alefa avy hatrany aorian'ny fidirana, alohan'ny baiko copy-to-TFTP, iray isaky ny andalana amin'ny endrika prompt|response. Ny fanontaniana dia ampifanandrifina ho toy ny fanehoana ara-dalàna tsy manavaka sora-baventy na kely amin'ny vokatra avy amin'ny Fitaovana (ka tsy afaka ahitana | ny tenany, ary tsy maintsy asiana famantarana fandosirana ny fononteny sy ny marika manokana hafa, oh. Save \\[y/n\\]), ary ny valiny dia alefa araka izay nosoratana, na ampiasao ny <CR> handefasana fiverenana andalana fotsiny. Alefa ihany ny valiny rehefa hita ny fanontaniana mifanaraka aminy, na ao amin'ny valin'ny valiny teo aloha na ao amin'ny vokatra manaraka; raha tsy izany dia misy fampitandremana voarakitra ary tsy misy na inona na inona alefa. Ireo no valiana voalohany; ny fanontaniana Any Key etsy ambony dia valiana any aoriana, mandritra ny fampavitrihana ny Fitaovana, koa ny fanontaniana voavaly eto dia tsy tonga any amin'ny Any Key mihitsy. Ohatra: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana ankapobeny"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Fomba fiseho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Tokony aseho eo amin'ny Console sa eo amin'ny tabilao ambony ny kirakira Router."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Konsoly"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Kiheba ambony"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Andalana manodidina ny fahasamihafan'ny fandrindrana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny andalana tsy niova voafaritra mialoha haseho aloha sy aorian'ny fanovana tsirairay rehefa mampitaha tahiry roa. Ny sanda lehibe kokoa dia manamora ny fahitana ny tontolon'ny fikirakirana manodidina. Azo ovaina isaky ny fampitahana ao amin'ny pejy Fampitahana izany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Lany ny fetr'andro fifandraisana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Fotoana farany ambony hiandrasana amin'ny segondra rehefa mametraka ny fifandraisana tambajotra voalohany amin'ny fitaovana iray. Avela ny fitaovana mihantona na tsy azo idirana aorian'io fe-potoana io mba hitohizan'ny fitahirizana voalahatra miaraka amin'ireo fitaovana sisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Akatony tsy mivoaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Raha voamarika, rehefa manidy ny fifandraisana amin'ny Fitaovana, dia tsy misy baiko 'exit' alefa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Buffer fifandraisana ho an'ny fitiliana hadisoana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Na hosoratana anaty diary ny vokatra mivantana avy amin'ny fifandraisana amin'ny Fitaovana na tsia"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Heverina ho manana zo ambony avokoa ny fitaovana rehetra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Na heverina fa manana fahefana avo ny Fitaovana rehetra na tsia"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Ora fampidinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Ny ora ao anatin'ny andro hanaovana ny fampidinana feno."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Fandaharam-potoana fanandramana indray"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Ny fotoana andrasana alohan'ny hanandramana fampidinana fanampiny rehefa tsy mahomby ny fampidinana voalahatra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Fe-potoana fitahirizana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny andro hitahirizana ny tahiry vonjimaika taloha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Tehirizo ny tahiry fiarovana ho an'ny Fitaovana tsy mavitrika"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanadiovana fitahirizana dia tsy hamafa ny tahiry tranainy izay an'ny Fitaovana tsy mavitrika na an'ny Fitaovana nesorina, mba hitahirizana ny fandrindrana ho an'ny Fitaovana tsy ampiasaina intsony na tsy azo idirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Safidy famindrana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Karazana fifandraisana mahazatra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Karazana fifandraisana mahazatra ampiasaina hifandraisana amin'ny Fitaovana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Saraho araka ny Fitaovana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Saraho ho anaty lahatahiry iray isaky ny Fitaovana ireo fikirakirana voatahiry"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Zana-lahatahiry misy daty"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Ampidiro zana-lahatahiry mifototra amin'ny daty ao amin'ny lalan'ny tahiry (alohan'ny lahatahiry isaky ny fitaovana), mba hotehirizina eo ambanin'ny datin'ny tahiry ny fandehanana tsirairay, ohatra: .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Raha tsy alefa dia mitazona ny firafitra efa misy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Lalana SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
