#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Ampidiro ny Fahasamihafan'ny Fandrindrana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Ampio unified diff ho an'ny fitaovana tsirairay niova fanamboarana nandritra ny fandehanana ao amin'ny Mailaka tahiry, mba hahitan'ny mpandinika tsara izay niova. Tsy raharahaina ny fanamboarana binary (tsy lahatsoratra). Tsy raharahaina foana ireo andalana miovaova isaky ny manao tahiry (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' sy 'Current configuration :', ary NX-OS '!Time:' sy '!Running configuration last done at:'). Fampitandremana: alefa amin'ny lahatsoratra mazava any amin'ny mpandray rehetra ny Mailaka ny diff, ka mety hamoaka fanamboarana tokony hijanona ho tsiambaratelo; aza asiana marika ny Ampidiro ny Tsiambaratelo ao amin'ny Diffs."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Ampidiro ao anatin'ny Fahasamihafana ny Tsiambaratelo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Alefaso araka izay tena izy ny sanda miafina ao amin'ny fahasamihafana alefa amin'ny mailaka. Rehefa tsy voamarika (ny mahazatra), ny andalana niova dia hita ao amin'ny fikirakirana manta ary atonta voafehy sy voasivana, mikatona raha misy hadisoana: ny andalana misy teny toy ny tsiambaratelo (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) sy ny andalan'ny mpampiantrano sy mpampiasa SNMP dia ahena ho amin'ny teny voalohany arahin'ny &lt;secret hidden&gt;, ary ny andalana tsirairay amin'ny vondrona PEM, ny mari-pankasitrahana na vondrona tady-fanalahidy, na sanda anaty teny notsongaina maro andalana, sy ny andalana hex na base64 rehetra, dia afenina; ny vondrona tsy mifarana dia manafina ny ambin'ny fikirakirana. Izany koa dia manafina andalana tsy mampidi-doza (ohatra: famaritana manonona fanalahidy), fa mbola miseho ihany ny andalana niova rehetra, voamarika hoe (changed) rehefa ny ampahany miafina ihany no samy hafa, ary voamarika ao amin'ny Mailaka ny vondrona tsy mifarana. Tsy ovaina na oviana ny kopia voatahiry."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Endrika avela amin'ny fampitahana (Diff)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Fanehoana ara-dalàna safidy (iray isaky ny andalana) mifanandrify amin'ny andalana fikandrana tsy raharahaina rehefa mampitaha, mba tsy hiseho ho fiovana ireo andalana miovaova toy ny mari-potoana na laharan'ny andiany. Ny endrika tsirairay dia ampifanandrifina tsy manavaka sora-baventy na kely na aiza na aiza ao amin'ny andalana raha tsy voafetra amin'ny ^ na $; tsy raharahaina ny endrika izay tsy fanehoana ara-dalàna manan-kery."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Thold Notification List"
msgstr "Lisitry ny Fampandrenesana Thold"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When Thold is installed, also send the backup Email to the recipients of the selected Thold Notification List."
msgstr "Rehefa tafapetraka ny Thold, alefaso any amin'ireo mpandray ao amin'ny Lisitra fampahafantarana Thold voafantina ihany koa ny Mailaka tahiry."

